  "ruleText": "Rev 204.01 Applicability. This part shall apply to all proceedings conducted by the presiding officer, except as otherwise provided in this chapter or by statute.\n\nSource. #4060, eff 5-29-86, EXPIRED: 5-29-92\n\nNew. #5423, eff 6-23-92; ss by #6749, eff 5-19-98, EXPIRED: 5-19-06\n\nNew. #8658-A, eff 6-13-06; ss by #11185-A, eff 9-20-16",
